801
00:31:35.280 --> 00:31:39.832
And they liked the idea. So they gave me $5,000 to do it.

802
00:31:39.832 --> 00:31:40.900
It's amazing you didn't go into becoming

803
00:31:40.900 --> 00:31:42.900
some huge garmento.
I should have.

