818
00:32:13.490 --> 00:32:15.640
And he stayed in touch with me.

819
00:32:15.640 --> 00:32:17.850
So I went back to the neighborhood, I run my business,

820
00:32:17.850 --> 00:32:20.000
kept building it up and he stayed in touch with me.

821
