He called me, this guy called me every month, on the month.

822
00:32:24.260 --> 00:32:26.044
Have you sold your business yet?

823
00:32:26.044 --> 00:32:26.877
Have you gone to Wall Street?

824
00:32:26.877 --> 00:32:28.480
No, Al, stop calling me.

825
00:32:28.480 --> 00:32:31.380
Every month for like 35 months.

826
00:32:31.380 --> 00:32:32.213
Wow.

827
00:32:32.213 --> 00:32:35.740
Okay? And finally he convinces me.

828
00:32:35.740 --> 00:32:36.573
He calls me one day and he says,

829
